{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEADSWITCH COMBAT</strong> is an action packed 2D multiplayer shooter that builds upon the previous games.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RANKED PROGRESSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408170/extras/662c27aa7974665d51348fc79cfc60e5.avif?t=1757730647\" width=720 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress through the ranks</strong> by earning XP in-game by killing enemies, scoring objectives, and completing challenges. Unlock new weapons, attachments, equipment, and vehicles to help you achieve victory in combat. Play <strong>solo</strong> or <strong>team-based</strong> game modes with other players online, or play local games against bots to hone your skills.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CO-OP SURVIVAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408170/extras/8b5d4d8b6b31205f724723a02897c74c.avif?t=1757730647\" width=720 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play one of many Survival modes</strong> and last as long as you can against endless waves of soldiers, helicopters, zombies, and other creatures. Submit your score in the worldwide leaderboards!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FULL WEAPON CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408170/extras/3956cdb800de220adad48fa31692d215.avif?t=1757730647\" width=720 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Personalize over 200 weapons</strong> with optics, lasers, grips, skins, and other accessories.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IN-GAME EDITOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408170/extras/43f82d52fa88313466e2eef66fa017f4.avif?t=1757730647\" width=720 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your own maps and missions</strong> with the in-game editor and instantly play them with friends online! Share or browse creations in the Workshop.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BETA TESTING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the Discord</strong> to start beta testing before launch! Check the links to the right --&gt;</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty of game modes and maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive selection of weapons, attachments, equipment, and skins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully customizable characters and loadouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranked matches, multiplayer clans, and custom servers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense fast-paced gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game editor and mod-friendly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom multiplayer servers</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3408170?t=1757730647","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408170/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757730647","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408170/a2968fe64145d0e30022916d88a02d5514d169d9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757730647","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408170/a2968fe64145d0e30022916d88a02d5514d169d9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757730647","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Discord Community</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408170/extras/ae5bde5d7ae90822ff9995989a7630f7.avif?t=1757730647\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the official Discord server to start beta testing!</strong> Check the links to the right --&gt;</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEADSWITCH COMBAT</strong> is an action packed 2D multiplayer shooter that builds upon the previous games.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RANKED PROGRESSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408170/extras/662c27aa7974665d51348fc79cfc60e5.avif?t=1757730647\" width=720 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress through the ranks</strong> by earning XP in-game by killing enemies, scoring objectives, and completing challenges. Unlock new weapons, attachments, equipment, and vehicles to help you achieve victory in combat. Play <strong>solo</strong> or <strong>team-based</strong> game modes with other players online, or play local games against bots to hone your skills.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CO-OP SURVIVAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408170/extras/8b5d4d8b6b31205f724723a02897c74c.avif?t=1757730647\" width=720 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play one of many Survival modes</strong> and last as long as you can against endless waves of soldiers, helicopters, zombies, and other creatures. Submit your score in the worldwide leaderboards!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FULL WEAPON CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408170/extras/3956cdb800de220adad48fa31692d215.avif?t=1757730647\" width=720 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Personalize over 200 weapons</strong> with optics, lasers, grips, skins, and other accessories.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IN-GAME EDITOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408170/extras/43f82d52fa88313466e2eef66fa017f4.avif?t=1757730647\" width=720 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your own maps and missions</strong> with the in-game editor and instantly play them with friends online! Share or browse creations in the Workshop.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BETA TESTING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the Discord</strong> to start beta testing before launch! Check the links to the right --&gt;</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty of game modes and maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive selection of weapons, attachments, equipment, and skins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully customizable characters and loadouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranked matches, multiplayer clans, and custom servers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense fast-paced gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game editor and mod-friendly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom multiplayer servers</p></li></ul>","developers":["W